  /// pawn (STRIP). With target or cell: the removal designations DECONSTRUCT,
  /// MINE, CUT_PLANT (chop-wood on a harvestable tree), HAUL and
  /// REMOVE_FOUNDATION, through the game's own designator, held by the named
